  "statement": "# Shadow Walker — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nObserve deterministic guard vision and patrol timing, cross when attention is elsewhere, and complete an infiltration without combat.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA compact top-down stealth game with three independently addressable infiltration levels, readable detection, capture/failure, retry, and final success after clearing all three levels.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the floor plan, patrols, distractions, objectives, and visual readability language.\n"
